<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche, Akzo unit settle dispute.</title>
<headline>Roche, Akzo unit settle dispute.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Roche Holding AG said it and Organon Teknika BV, a unit of Dutch chemicals group Akzo Nobel NV, had signed a worldwide settlement agreement ending several patent disputes that had led to lawsuits in Europe and the United States.</p>
</text>
